DEFINE BAR 3 OF _47c0t5win PROMPT "White Yarn Openings"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF _47c0t5win do form woolop
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF _47c0t5win do form yrsupop
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF _47c0t5win do form yrnop

